WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 1, Scene 32h: Lunar Base interior or Disc 2 ending moment
Duration: ~25 seconds
Source: FF8 Gameplay/Cutscene
Describes either the interior of the Lunar Base or a key moment as the team arrives and Rinoa's condition shifts

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The pod has docked. The interior of the Lunar Base is revealed. Corridors are sterile and functional — white walls with blue accent lighting integrated into every panel and seam. The station hums with the sound of life support systems and power generators.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The party exits the pod into the base. Squall moves alongside Rinoa, her comatose form still unresponsive. The other party members follow, weapons at their sides, alert despite their exhaustion from the journey.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
A medical or observation chamber is entered. Rinoa is carefully placed in a containment field or medical pod — technology designed to preserve and monitor her condition. Blue energy surrounds her form, holding her stable.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Something begins to change. A subtle glow emanates from Rinoa. Her eyes move beneath closed lids. For a moment, it appears she might be awakening. But the glow intensifies unnaturally — not the warmth of consciousness, but something otherworldly.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The camera pulls back as the implications settle. Rinoa's body lies suspended in the energy field, transformed by whatever force has taken control. Squall's face shows anguish and grim determination. The team stands on the precipice of a new crisis, unaware of what now inhabits Rinoa's body.
